{"id":"wb-2-16","name":"修定寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"修定寺塔","text":"修定寺塔位于中国河南省安阳市安阳县磊口乡清凉山村西侧(36.19564° N, 113.99841° E )，1982年被列为第二批全国重点文物保护单位。\n修定寺始建于北魏太和十八年（494年），初名天城寺，北齐时改称合水寺，北周武帝灭法时被毁，隋代重建，改称修定禅寺。明嘉靖年间曾有过一次大修缮，使整个建筑群持续到清末。现仅存唐代所建佛塔一座。修定寺塔单层，平面呈方形，高20米，塔身四壁以雕砖砌成，共用雕砖3775块，为世所罕见。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BF%AE%E5%AE%9A%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86343695,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86343695","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/445606192e99eb6edbb5e479.jpg","title":"安阳修定寺塔.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%AE%89%E9%98%B3%E4%BF%AE%E5%AE%9A%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/%E5%AE%89%E9%98%B3%E4%BF%AE%E5%AE%9A%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Acot一杯茶","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​安陽修定寺塔為唐朝修定寺僅存的建築，出自該塔的數塊磚雕描繪胡騰舞者的形象，顯然受到中亞-西域文化的影響。","width":320,"height":212}}